DESCRIPTION:The Brian Felix Organ Trio is the jazz/funk organ group of the
  future. Rooted in the deep traditions of organ-driven jazz\, funk\, and s
 oul\, the trio blends reggae\, samba\, surf rock\, gospel\, and ambient so
 undscapes into a unified and forward-looking musical vision. Known for its
  telepathic interplay\, deep grooves\, and daring spontaneity\, the trio h
 as been captivating audiences throughout the southeastern United States. T
 he group’s most recent release\, Level Up (Slimtrim Records\, 2025)\, a 
 collection of all-original compositions\, has been described as “delight
 ful and eclectic” (Noah Baerman\, noahjazz.com) and its title track appe
